/CHANGES TO THE SIGN-CHECKING ROUTINES FOR MULTIPLY/DIVIDE
/IN ORDER TO SHORTEN THEM SOMEWHAT TO MAKE ROOM FOR "ZERO".

	*7102
	JMS RESOLV	/EXIT FROM 'FMUL' AND 'FDIV'
	JMS I .+2	/SET SIGN AND NORMALIZE
	JMP I .-3
	DNORM

